{"abstract":"De videregående uddannelser kan gøre en forskel i klimakampen. Men det kræver, at ledelserne sikrer, at grønomstilling ikke blot bliver en eftertanke eller et add-on på et kursus hist og her, skriver en række forskere og ansatte på de videregående uddannelser.","author_count":16,"contributors":["Ejsing, Mads","Vitting-Seerup, Sabrina","Mehlsen, David","Dalgaard Pøhler, Jesper","Jørgensen, Michael Søgaard","Achiam, Marianne","Jordt Jørgensen, Nanna","Laugesen, Martin Hauberg-Lund","Beck Nielsen, Søren","Samson, Kristine","Andersen, Nicolai Bo","Borregaard, Michael Krabbe","Hjort Bønløkke, Jakob","Brarud Jordal, Niklas"],"cuid":["S02-093.18-716367"],"filters":{"added":"2023-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Tværfaglighed","Uddannelse"],"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-ART","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"ART":["DI-ART-ALL","DI-ART-RDKA"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC","DI-U-SDU"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-ART-RDKA","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC","DI-U-SDU","DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"forskere og ansatte videregående uddannelser skal gå ind i klimakampen nu","src":["ku","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.altinget.dk/forskning/artikel/forskere-og-ansatte-det-er-paa-hoeje-tid-at-vores-ledelser-indser-at-groen-omstilling-ikke-bare-er-en-multiple-choice-oevelse","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-093.18-716367","ids":["ku-2cdc9352-1b9e-4dcc-b5d4-1ef90fc30be8","ruc-29e78ac2-623a-4b46-a18d-2548728a94e7"],"keyword":["Klimadannelse","Tværfaglighed","Uddannelse"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-BB06A104BE783DE46184A8241ECBB2C4"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhage